Z||000038||sqoach||12-10-2001||07:37 PM||||Looks pretty good. I like the way it changes the look of the pod. That makes it look much more modern. I do agree about the speaker grilles, though. Maybe have an option or something for that. Not sure if that would be worth the trouble though. Personally, I think 5 1/4" or 6 1/2" speakers would be great in the dash. Also, it look as though the stock aux. gauges are going to be covered? Or is there going to be a need to get new gauges? I'd probably buy one if the price was around $500. Can't wait to see it finished.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>                <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif"> <BR><B>86 SE V6 - daily driver</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 Sport Coupe 2.5L 5spd (soon to be sold)</FONT>||||reg||14
